OL,3,GNEWSAMP vows to meet water firm again
OL,4,Aover outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said he will meet senior
OL,7,Ffigures at Anglian Water "again" after
OL,8,Frural businesses were left without
OL,9,Fwater due to burst pipes.
OL,11,FStuart Andrew, the Conservative MP for
OL,12,FDaventry, said areas including East
OL,13,FFarndon and Clipston in
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire were affected over the
OL,15,Fweekend.
OL,17,FPeople in these villages were also
OL,18,Fwithout water during a heatwave in May.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
