OL,3,GNEWSAMP vows to meet water firm again
OL,4,Aover outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water thanked customers for
OL,7,Ftheir patience while its teams restored
OL,8,Fsupplies as "quickly and safely as
OL,9,Fpossible".
